\">Am 4:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">פַּעַם וּשְׁתָּ֑יִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:20\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.20\">Ne 13:20</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.14\">Je 3:14</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶחָד מֵעִיר וּשְׁנַיִם מִמִּשְׁפָחָה</span> = a small no.; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:13\" href=\"/Ezra.10.13\">Ezr 10:13</a> <em>not for one or two days</em> (but for many), <a data-ref=\"II Kings 6:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.6.10\">2 K 6:10</a>."}], "num": "b."}], "num": "1."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<em>twelve:</em> c. n.m. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁנֵים עָשָׂר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:13\" href=\"/Genesis.42.13\">Gn 42:13</a> + 87 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">לִשְׁנֵי עָשָׂר</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:21\" href=\"/Exodus.28.21\">Ex 28:21</a> + 4 times; c. n.f. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁתֵּים עֶשְׂרֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 24:4\" href=\"/Exodus.24.4\">Ex 24:4</a> + 34 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁתֵּי עֶשְׂרֵה</span> †<a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.1\">Ez 32:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.17\">17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.21\">33:21</a>; before n.pl. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:20\" href=\"/Genesis.17.20\">Gn 17:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:27\" href=\"/Exodus.15.27\">Ex 15:27</a> +; after n.pl. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:84\" href=\"/Numbers.7.84\">Nu 7:84</a><sup>(×2)</sup> +; before n.sg. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:21\" href=\"/Exodus.28.21\">Ex 28:21</a> +, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:4\" href=\"/Genesis.14.4\">Gn 14:4</a> (<a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:12\" href=\"/Genesis.14.12\">12</a> <em>year</em>) +, etc.; as ord., <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּיוֹם שְׁנֵים עָשָׂר יוֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:78\" href=\"/Numbers.7.78\">Nu 7:78</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּשְׁתֵּי עֶשְׂרֵה שָׁנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.1\">Ez 32:1</a> +, etc."}], "num": "2."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "with large num.: 10 (etc.) + 2, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.5\">2 S 